WEBVTT

00:00:12.350 --> 00:00:14.520
Okay, that's enough!

00:00:14.520 --> 00:00:16.230
Stop already!

00:00:16.230 --> 00:00:18.060
Guys, seriously...

00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:34.400
You fools!

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:38.650
I'm fine with you having some fun
during your warmups!

00:00:38.650 --> 00:00:41.440
But it's your responsibility
as captain to figure out

00:00:41.440 --> 00:00:44.350
how far things should go!

00:00:44.350 --> 00:00:47.560
I'm terribly sorry! This is all my fault!

00:00:47.560 --> 00:00:52.060
We're going to lose some support
because Ochi got a fracture

00:00:52.060 --> 00:00:56.600
but if something happened
to you, we'd be finished!

00:00:56.600 --> 00:00:57.770
I guess you boys

00:00:57.770 --> 00:01:01.650
really can't lose this match
now, for Ochi's sake.

00:01:01.650 --> 00:01:04.270
All of you need to get your
heads back into the game!

00:01:04.270 --> 00:01:05.270
Yes, sir!

00:01:08.940 --> 00:01:11.480
I'm perfectly fine.

00:01:11.480 --> 00:01:13.900
Thank goodness only one of us got hurt.

00:01:14.940 --> 00:01:17.020
Even before we were playing

00:01:17.020 --> 00:01:20.150
this game for Ochi, we came here to win.

00:01:20.150 --> 00:01:21.560
Am I right?

00:01:22.900 --> 00:01:26.270
All right. Let's go crush Seiin!

00:01:26.270 --> 00:01:28.230
Yeah!

00:01:29.850 --> 00:01:30.980
We will now begin

00:01:30.980 --> 00:01:36.650
the Spring Nationals Fukui Prefecture
Representative Play-offs.

00:01:36.650 --> 00:01:41.270
The boys finals will be between
Fukuho Technical High School

00:01:41.270 --> 00:01:45.350
and Seiin Nanafu High School.

00:01:45.350 --> 00:01:50.020
And now, allow me to introduce the
starting lineup for Fukuho Technical High.

00:01:50.020 --> 00:01:54.520
#1, Subaru Mimura.

00:01:50.170 --> 00:01:54.130
m 829 301 l 1219 301 1219 326 829 326

00:01:50.170 --> 00:01:54.130
Fukuho Technical High School

00:01:54.520 --> 00:01:57.260
#2, Jungo Takasugi.

00:01:55.770 --> 00:01:57.260
Subaru!

00:01:59.230 --> 00:02:02.730
The cheers here will make me stronger.

00:02:04.100 --> 00:02:05.900
We're going to win this!

00:02:07.440 --> 00:02:09.900
<i>We were so scared that we went numb</i>

00:02:09.900 --> 00:02:12.270
<i>And our legs buckled from under us</i>

00:02:12.270 --> 00:02:17.230
<i>We still can't forget the tears</i>
<i>that fell back then even now</i>

