{=0}2.43: Seiin High School Boys Volleyball Team

00:02:27.100 --> 00:02:31.900
<i>What should we do?</i>
<i>We're not used to facing adversity</i>

00:02:31.900 --> 00:02:37.060
<i>So our resolve's definitely not all there</i>

00:02:37.060 --> 00:02:39.480
<i>Back then, we were just</i>

00:02:39.480 --> 00:02:41.810
<i>Envious of others and</i>

00:02:41.810 --> 00:02:46.520
<i>Angry at something we couldn't see</i>

00:02:46.520 --> 00:02:49.060
<i>We just kept glaring at the next step</i>

00:02:49.060 --> 00:02:51.440
<i>That we could've easily taken</i>

00:02:51.440 --> 00:02:56.400
<i>And it was eating away at us silently</i>

00:02:57.810 --> 00:03:00.190
<i>We were so scared that we went numb</i>

00:03:00.190 --> 00:03:02.600
<i>And our legs buckled from under us</i>

00:03:02.600 --> 00:03:07.480
<i>We still can't forget the tears</i>
<i>that fell back then even now</i>

00:03:07.480 --> 00:03:12.270
<i>Even though we're so frail we might break,</i>
<i>we still continued to seek love</i>

00:03:12.270 --> 00:03:17.440
<i>We don't want to forget the reason</i>
<i>we're standing on this stage</i>

00:03:17.440 --> 00:03:22.230
<i>Because you're the one who made me stronger</i>

00:03:22.230 --> 00:03:26.690
<i>I give you this lovely ballad</i>
<i>within this beautiful attack</i>

00:03:37.440 --> 00:03:40.400
Go, go, go, go, go, Fukuho!

00:03:40.400 --> 00:03:43.850
They aren't starting with Oda after all.

00:03:40.610 --> 00:03:43.740
The Hero and The Genius 1

00:03:40.610 --> 00:03:43.740
The Hero and The Genius 1

00:03:43.850 --> 00:03:46.810
They set their lineup
to match our lineup's height.

00:03:46.810 --> 00:03:50.690
I'm planning to end this before
they can take off running,

00:03:50.690 --> 00:03:53.850
but if the game lasts long,
that also gives us an advantage.

00:03:53.850 --> 00:03:58.810
Seiin hasn't had the chance
to play an official five-set match.

00:03:58.810 --> 00:04:03.230
Subaru, you sure you're good?

00:04:03.230 --> 00:04:05.230
Did someone say something?

00:04:05.230 --> 00:04:07.350
Well, it's just Tomoki said

00:04:07.350 --> 00:04:11.730
that Ochi looked like he
was protecting you back there.

00:04:11.730 --> 00:04:16.230
He seemed worried that
you might feel responsible.

00:04:16.230 --> 00:04:19.060
Tomoki's got nothing to worry about.

00:04:19.060 --> 00:04:21.730
Ochi and I are on the same page.

00:04:22.940 --> 00:04:26.650
Thank you for waiting.
The match is about to begin.

00:04:26.650 --> 00:04:30.900
Please give both teams a huge round of applause.

00:04:30.900 --> 00:04:36.060
Tomoki, get all the sets to me
just like in our practice match.

00:04:42.520 --> 00:04:43.600
Bring it!

00:04:47.980 --> 00:04:49.440
All right!

00:04:51.060 --> 00:04:53.060
Let's keep this up!

00:04:53.060 --> 00:04:56.270
Let's win this one for Ochi- <i>senpai</i> !

00:04:56.270 --> 00:04:58.850
Were you even listening to me?

00:04:58.850 --> 00:05:03.310
We're going to win this anyway,
whether it be for Ochi or not, remember?

00:05:12.560 --> 00:05:14.020
It's falling up front?!

00:05:20.310 --> 00:05:22.440
Good call, Yuhi!

00:05:22.550 --> 00:05:24.550
Seiin

00:05:22.550 --> 00:05:24.550
Fukuho Tech

00:05:28.060 --> 00:05:29.650
Now it's not falling.

00:05:31.440 --> 00:05:32.810
Go, Kuroba!

00:05:41.310 --> 00:05:42.060
Yes!

00:05:42.060 --> 00:05:43.560
Yes!

00:05:42.190 --> 00:05:43.400
Seiin

00:05:42.190 --> 00:05:44.650
Fukuho Tech

00:05:43.400 --> 00:05:43.440
Seiin

00:05:43.560 --> 00:05:44.850
It's all right, don't worry about it!

00:05:44.650 --> 00:05:44.690
Fukuho Tech

00:05:44.850 --> 00:05:46.310
Keep calling those shots!

00:05:46.310 --> 00:05:48.690
Keep your eyes on the left!

00:05:48.690 --> 00:05:53.270
Ochi, everything's going
according to your strategy.

00:05:53.270 --> 00:05:58.690
I made up my mind when Ochi
protected me from my fall.

00:06:00.850 --> 00:06:04.060
Subaru, Kuroba isn't great
with overhand serves and doesn't

00:06:04.060 --> 00:06:05.900
know what to do when the ball wavers.

00:06:05.900 --> 00:06:09.100
Have whoever's doing jump float serves
make sure it lands around him.

00:06:09.100 --> 00:06:11.770
Yeah, I got it. You told us already.

00:06:11.770 --> 00:06:15.650
Listen, don't let the others worry about me.

00:06:15.650 --> 00:06:19.810
Make sure they just laugh at how clumsy I am.

00:06:19.810 --> 00:06:21.690
Ochi...

00:06:21.690 --> 00:06:25.400
Sorry, Subaru. I have to be away
from the front lines for a while,

00:06:25.400 --> 00:06:28.150
but I'll be back as soon as I can.

00:06:28.150 --> 00:06:30.100
Before Ochi gets back...

00:06:33.850 --> 00:06:35.480
We're gonna end this!

00:06:41.330 --> 00:06:44.340
Seiin

00:06:41.330 --> 00:06:44.340
Fukuho Tech

00:06:41.690 --> 00:06:44.560
Hell yeah! We took the first set!

00:06:44.560 --> 00:06:46.440
Let's keep this up!

00:06:46.440 --> 00:06:47.980
Yeah!

00:06:47.980 --> 00:06:50.230
Oh, thanks, Och--

00:06:50.230 --> 00:06:51.560
Um...

00:06:51.560 --> 00:06:53.100
Er, thanks...

00:06:53.100 --> 00:06:56.650
Let's go, Subaru! Let's go, Subaru!

00:06:56.650 --> 00:07:00.440
He's our hero!

00:07:00.440 --> 00:07:01.810
Yeah!

00:07:00.440 --> 00:07:05.350
Go! Go! Go! Go! Go!

00:07:05.350 --> 00:07:08.980
Yeah... We're not obviously
the away team here, or anything.

00:07:08.980 --> 00:07:11.230
18 to 25...

00:07:11.230 --> 00:07:13.980
Fukuho totally took the flow of that game.

00:07:13.980 --> 00:07:17.190
I'm sorry that I couldn't get any in.

00:07:17.190 --> 00:07:19.650
They've all got their eyes on you the most.

00:07:19.650 --> 00:07:23.770
Don't sweat it and just
think about hitting every ball.

00:07:23.770 --> 00:07:27.650
This just proves that they see you
as a threat. Keep your head up.

00:07:27.650 --> 00:07:29.400
R-Right...

00:07:30.090 --> 00:07:32.590
Seiin

00:07:30.090 --> 00:07:32.590
Fukuho Tech

00:07:39.310 --> 00:07:42.600
They've got three blockers on Kuroba...

00:07:49.940 --> 00:07:51.940
They keep aiming their serves at him, too.

00:07:51.940 --> 00:07:54.810
We're hitting the ball back less than 20% now.

00:07:54.810 --> 00:07:57.650
And...

00:07:57.650 --> 00:07:59.480
He's not even playing seriously yet.

00:08:03.730 --> 00:08:04.980
I'll dump and...

00:08:09.520 --> 00:08:10.770
Mimura, too?

00:08:14.510 --> 00:08:16.180
Seiin

00:08:14.510 --> 00:08:16.180
Fukuho Tech

00:08:15.310 --> 00:08:16.560
Calm down!

00:08:16.560 --> 00:08:18.650
Calm down and let's get this one!

00:08:20.020 --> 00:08:21.770
They're four points ahead...

00:08:21.770 --> 00:08:24.150
We can't let them pull even further ahead.

00:08:28.520 --> 00:08:29.520
Right!

00:08:32.190 --> 00:08:33.700
Seiin

00:08:32.190 --> 00:08:33.700
Fukuho Tech

00:08:33.900 --> 00:08:35.100
Yes!

00:08:37.900 --> 00:08:39.980
Now, they're three points head.

00:08:39.980 --> 00:08:41.980
We can catch up in no time!

00:08:44.400 --> 00:08:45.270
Free ball!

00:08:45.270 --> 00:08:46.230
Move!

00:08:49.900 --> 00:08:51.730
Two points...

00:08:51.730 --> 00:08:53.020
You're not cutting us off!

00:09:01.520 --> 00:09:03.310
Seiin

00:09:01.520 --> 00:09:03.310
Fukuho Tech

00:09:03.810 --> 00:09:05.020
Time out!

00:09:06.310 --> 00:09:07.600
And now...

00:09:10.810 --> 00:09:12.310
One point difference.

00:09:14.150 --> 00:09:18.020
I could've hit that 13th point.

00:09:18.020 --> 00:09:22.020
You're being too pushy, Haijima.

00:09:22.020 --> 00:09:24.560
I just took the better opportunity,

00:09:24.560 --> 00:09:26.190
and in that case, it was me.

00:09:26.190 --> 00:09:27.230
Yeah, but...

00:09:27.230 --> 00:09:31.230
As long as they've marked Kuroba,
the rest of us have to break through this!

00:09:31.230 --> 00:09:33.850
I need you all to concentrate more,
or I won't be able to set to you!

00:09:33.850 --> 00:09:35.730
Don't any of you want to go to
the Tokyo Metropolitan Gymnasium?!

00:09:35.730 --> 00:09:37.400
H-Haijima!

00:09:38.730 --> 00:09:41.230
No...

00:09:41.230 --> 00:09:44.900
At this rate, it'll end up
the same as every other time.

00:09:44.900 --> 00:09:47.230
I don't want to make everyone mad.

00:09:47.230 --> 00:09:49.100
I want to win as a team!

00:09:49.100 --> 00:09:52.770
I want to take you all to the nationals!

00:09:52.770 --> 00:09:55.850
We can't really argue with him.

00:09:55.850 --> 00:10:00.270
We're basically the ones
making Haijima say all of this.

00:10:00.270 --> 00:10:04.940
We were supposed to put our lives on the line
for this match and go to nationals.

00:10:04.940 --> 00:10:09.060
But the truth is, we're barely
hanging on because of Haijima.

00:10:09.060 --> 00:10:10.900
Aoki...

00:10:10.900 --> 00:10:13.520
I'm backing up Haijima here.

00:10:13.520 --> 00:10:15.900
Thanks, Aoki...

00:10:41.440 --> 00:10:42.900
Nice, Hokao!

00:10:48.060 --> 00:10:49.520
One more!

00:10:59.440 --> 00:11:00.350
Hell yeah!

00:11:00.350 --> 00:11:02.400
Now, we're tied!

00:11:00.470 --> 00:11:02.510
Seiin

00:11:00.470 --> 00:11:02.510
Fukuho Tech

00:11:02.810 --> 00:11:06.400
Hokao, Kanno! You kicked ass!

00:11:06.400 --> 00:11:08.270
N-Nice...

00:11:08.270 --> 00:11:11.060
Well, if Aoki- <i>senpai</i> 's got your back...

00:11:11.060 --> 00:11:13.690
...I guess we do, too.

00:11:13.690 --> 00:11:15.940
Let's beat them, Haijima!

00:11:15.940 --> 00:11:16.940
Right!

00:11:19.230 --> 00:11:21.350
Now we're just waiting on you...

00:11:22.480 --> 00:11:23.600
Kuroba!

