00:11:38.520 --> 00:11:41.020
So that's the genius from Tokyo...

00:11:41.020 --> 00:11:44.440
But as a team, you guys are still far superior.

00:11:44.440 --> 00:11:47.520
Don't lose heart and turn
things around in the third set.

00:11:47.520 --> 00:11:50.520
Tighten your blocks and make sure
their spikes don't get through!

00:11:50.520 --> 00:11:54.270
Yuhi, make sure you keep a sharp eye
on their #8 and his dumps.

00:11:54.270 --> 00:11:55.270
Right!

00:11:58.310 --> 00:12:01.100
He really is a monster...

00:12:03.600 --> 00:12:05.980
Ochi, can I get some ice...

00:12:06.980 --> 00:12:09.520
Whoops, my bad. I just said that out of habit.

00:12:09.520 --> 00:12:11.100
I'll go get you some ice.

00:12:11.100 --> 00:12:12.560
Thanks.

00:12:19.690 --> 00:12:22.600
It'll be all right. My knees are holding up.

00:12:22.600 --> 00:12:24.150
I don't feel any pain.

00:12:24.150 --> 00:12:27.310
But that monster #8...

00:12:27.310 --> 00:12:30.150
What would you do, Ochi?

00:12:30.150 --> 00:12:31.350
Subaru.

00:12:32.390 --> 00:12:34.350
Ochi

00:12:32.390 --> 00:12:34.350
I'm heading back now

00:12:34.770 --> 00:12:37.690
He's planning coming right back to the bench.

00:12:37.690 --> 00:12:40.190
What an idiot. He's the biggest fool we have.

00:12:40.320 --> 00:12:42.530
Ochi

00:12:40.320 --> 00:12:42.530
I'm heading back now

00:12:43.770 --> 00:12:45.190
Guess it's time.

00:12:51.230 --> 00:12:54.150
All right! We're taking these next two sets

00:12:54.150 --> 00:12:56.730
and wrapping things up before Ochi gets back!

00:12:56.730 --> 00:12:58.020
Yeah!

00:13:06.190 --> 00:13:08.350
Look at that confidence.

00:13:08.350 --> 00:13:10.190
He's only looking at the court.

00:13:10.190 --> 00:13:13.900
He must be playing volleyball
with the purest of feelings.

00:13:13.900 --> 00:13:16.730
I used to be like that, too.

00:13:16.730 --> 00:13:20.100
But now, I've got way more on my back.

00:13:20.100 --> 00:13:22.480
I can't say that I envy you.

00:13:22.480 --> 00:13:26.940
This is something I can only do now
because I have so much riding on this.

00:13:26.940 --> 00:13:28.400
Subaru- <i>senpai</i> .

00:13:28.400 --> 00:13:31.400
The first set's going to you,
so blast it in there!

00:13:37.560 --> 00:13:39.810
The Demon Bazooka...

00:13:39.810 --> 00:13:43.770
I don't know who came up
with that name, but talk about lame.

00:13:43.770 --> 00:13:47.600
But now, I actually like it.

00:13:47.600 --> 00:13:50.940
You can't stop me with 2.5 blockers!

00:13:59.980 --> 00:14:02.350
Mimura took it up a notch.

00:14:02.350 --> 00:14:06.060
The speed and sound of that spike is way
different than the ones in the last set!

00:14:07.230 --> 00:14:08.650
Okay, you've got this!

00:14:08.650 --> 00:14:11.940
Don't let them get too far ahead!
Every point is important!

00:14:11.940 --> 00:14:13.690
Let's cut him off at one!

00:14:13.690 --> 00:14:14.730
All right!

00:14:14.730 --> 00:14:16.270
Let's cut him off at one!

