We're going to take the game back!

00:15:38.650 --> 00:15:41.690
We're switching out once
Kuroba goes to the back.

00:15:41.690 --> 00:15:44.230
Are you going to get switched out
without doing anything?

00:15:50.350 --> 00:15:51.560
On the left!

00:15:51.560 --> 00:15:53.230
Hit a cross shot!

00:15:53.230 --> 00:15:54.810
Break through!

00:16:00.560 --> 00:16:01.690
