00:17:05.190 --> 00:17:07.520
...and Fukuho sure are strong.

00:17:07.520 --> 00:17:10.900
I felt we might be on the
same level at our practice match,

00:17:10.900 --> 00:17:15.400
but they seem like an
even bigger obstacle today.

00:17:15.400 --> 00:17:18.480
But I still think we can win.

00:17:18.480 --> 00:17:21.980
We're a totally unbalanced,
little team with only eight players

00:17:21.980 --> 00:17:25.690
that's going to win against Fukuho
and win that ticket to Tokyo.

00:17:25.690 --> 00:17:28.350
I still believe that.

00:17:28.350 --> 00:17:31.650
You think I'm dreaming, Haijima?

00:17:31.650 --> 00:17:33.770
It's not a dream.

00:17:33.770 --> 00:17:38.520
I could clearly see the eight of us
stepping onto that orange court

00:17:38.520 --> 00:17:41.230
at the Tokyo Metropolitan
Gymnasium from the start.

00:17:41.230 --> 00:17:43.770
Well, you heard the brains of our team.

00:17:43.770 --> 00:17:47.810
This is the same guy who said
my height wouldn't work against Fukuho.

00:17:47.810 --> 00:17:50.480
Ain't no way he'd sugarcoat that.

00:17:51.770 --> 00:17:52.730
Guys.

00:17:52.730 --> 00:17:54.940
We're gonna hold out until Kuroba gets back.

00:17:54.940 --> 00:18:00.810
Until the last ball falls on the last set...
Believe that we're going to win!

00:18:00.810 --> 00:18:01.900
Yeah!

00:18:04.900 --> 00:18:07.060
Haijima, I'm sorry.

00:18:07.060 --> 00:18:10.270
I can't be like Mimura
and say, "Get me all the sets"

00:18:10.270 --> 00:18:13.940
even though I know you're hurting.

00:18:13.940 --> 00:18:19.100
I know I asked for you to wait for
this answer, but are you ready to hear it?

00:18:19.100 --> 00:18:21.980
You told me before, Oda.

00:18:21.980 --> 00:18:26.230
That you want to play volleyball
even a day, or even a second longer.

00:18:26.230 --> 00:18:30.650
Does that mean even if you're
off the court for the team?

00:18:30.650 --> 00:18:34.850
Or were you saying that, putting yourself first?

00:18:37.440 --> 00:18:40.940
You can ask anyone, and they'll
tell you that Fukuho's Mimura's team.

00:18:40.940 --> 00:18:44.810
But Seiin doesn't need to be my team.

00:18:44.810 --> 00:18:48.190
I'm not the one who's
gonna be scoring out front.

00:18:48.190 --> 00:18:50.270
We've got Kuroba and Kanno.

00:18:50.270 --> 00:18:52.440
And we've got you.

00:18:52.440 --> 00:18:56.270
If what I need to do for
this team lies somewhere else...

00:18:56.270 --> 00:18:59.190
...then I have nothing to be self-conscious of,

00:18:59.190 --> 00:19:01.850
and I don't have any regrets!

00:19:01.850 --> 00:19:03.980
Guess they got back onto their feet.

00:19:03.980 --> 00:19:05.850
But...

00:19:05.850 --> 00:19:08.850
Seiin without their #7--
they're like wounded lions

00:19:08.850 --> 00:19:11.400
and will come after us
with everything they've got!

00:19:11.400 --> 00:19:13.480
And we'll do everything to shut them down!

00:19:13.480 --> 00:19:14.810
Yeah!

