00:19:20.100 --> 00:19:25.150
I finally get to the venue just to see you
being escorted off covered in blood.

00:19:25.150 --> 00:19:28.480
Quit saying the same thing! Shut up, already!

00:19:31.560 --> 00:19:33.350
Jeez, you're in a bad mood.

00:19:33.350 --> 00:19:36.650
You're embarrassed cuz your nose started
bleeding in front of everyone, right?

00:19:36.650 --> 00:19:38.940
You're always so worried about appearances.

00:19:38.940 --> 00:19:42.440
When was it? The sports festival in third grade?

00:19:42.440 --> 00:19:44.400
You got dizzy and got a nosebleed

00:19:44.400 --> 00:19:47.690
and threw a fit in front of Auntie saying,
"I don't wanna go back to class!"

00:19:47.690 --> 00:19:50.060
Oh, shut up already!

00:19:50.060 --> 00:19:52.440
Who cares how I look?

00:19:52.440 --> 00:19:55.770
If I can go back onto the court,
I'll go back out naked!

00:19:55.770 --> 00:19:59.100
Then they'd just kick you out.
You know the TV crew's here, right?

00:19:59.100 --> 00:20:02.270
I didn't mean that literally, you idiot.

00:20:02.270 --> 00:20:05.520
By the way... Tilting your head up
won't stop the bleeding.

00:20:05.520 --> 00:20:07.600
I'm trying to get the blood to clot!

00:20:09.440 --> 00:20:14.770
So you're not going to run away
like last year. Well, that's a relief.

00:20:14.770 --> 00:20:16.900
Of course not!

00:20:16.900 --> 00:20:20.020
Hurry up and clot... Clot! Clot!

00:20:20.020 --> 00:20:21.770
Oh, Haijima.

00:20:24.980 --> 00:20:28.730
Haijima... Is there a time out?
What happened to the third se--

00:20:28.730 --> 00:20:30.690
We lost it.

00:20:30.690 --> 00:20:32.940
16 to 25.

00:20:35.850 --> 00:20:41.520
<i>I don't want a wish to end as just a wish</i>

00:20:43.100 --> 00:20:48.730
<i>But I know I'm going to live with that feeling</i>

00:20:50.350 --> 00:20:57.560
<i>And as I toss and turn</i>

00:20:57.560 --> 00:21:01.600
<i>The azure world smiles upon me</i>

00:21:06.520 --> 00:21:13.940
<i>The knife made up of words from my friend</i>

00:21:13.940 --> 00:21:20.900
<i>Still lingers inside my head today</i>

00:21:20.900 --> 00:21:27.060
<i>You glared up at the clouds high in the sky</i>

00:21:28.230 --> 00:21:33.520
<i>And near your house, the horizon undulated</i>

00:21:35.400 --> 00:21:40.980
<i>I don't want a wish to end as just a wish</i>

00:21:42.600 --> 00:21:48.100
<i>But I know I'm going to live with that feeling</i>

00:21:49.850 --> 00:21:57.020
<i>And as I toss and turn</i>

00:21:57.020 --> 00:22:05.230
<i>The azure world stabs me strongly in the back</i>

00:22:05.850 --> 00:22:08.770
Just leave for a bit.

00:22:05.970 --> 00:22:10.930
Infirmary

00:22:08.770 --> 00:22:10.810
Jeez, what's your problem?

00:22:12.150 --> 00:22:13.730
And?

00:22:13.730 --> 00:22:16.650
Kanno's been acting as the ace in your place,

00:22:16.650 --> 00:22:19.770
and Oda's been doing his best on defense...

00:22:19.770 --> 00:22:23.060
But their lead slowly started to grow...

00:22:23.060 --> 00:22:25.730
...and we lost the third set.

00:22:25.730 --> 00:22:29.980
Kuroba, you're the only one who has
a powerful enough spike to get past Fukuho.

00:22:29.980 --> 00:22:34.020
We need you for the fourth
and fifth set, no matter what!

00:22:34.020 --> 00:22:35.730
I'm fine now.

00:22:35.730 --> 00:22:36.940
I can go.

00:22:38.100 --> 00:22:39.810
You idiot!

00:22:39.810 --> 00:22:41.690
Damn it...

00:22:41.690 --> 00:22:44.270
Damn it, damn it!

00:22:45.400 --> 00:22:48.560
I still haven't done anything on that court.

00:22:48.560 --> 00:22:52.810
I can't let it end... Not like this...

00:22:56.060 --> 00:22:57.060
Gah!

00:22:57.060 --> 00:23:01.100
Oh? So that's the reaction I get.
